# Vercel is the edge only: upload just the Flask static files and this config.
# Everything else (backend code, data_ready/ ~260 MB, .env*, .runtime/, .venv/, node_modules/, frontend/)
# stays off Vercel; all other paths are proxied to the VM by the rewrite in vercel.json.
/*
!/static
!/vercel.json
.env*
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
